receive a packet with a lying length field
  header:  version 1, kind 1, 99 payload bytes
  refused: truncated or corrupt packet
receive a version 3 packet
  header:  version 3, kind 0, 0 payload bytes
  refused: unsupported version 3
receive bytes from some other protocol
  header:  not a packet
  refused: truncated or corrupt packet
